
Nhamba dzidza: ['plus:'] zvinoreva: ['+'].
Nhamba kana-zvasvika: ['+'] ita: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x chiyero-chenhamba.
	(currency = ['euros']) chokwadi: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (pachako plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars chiyero: ['dollars'].
euros chiyero: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Zvabuda nyora: money, mutsara-mutsva.
